:"`5.0`"},"625":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-13","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Maximum distance at which interact indicator sprites are rendered. Keep low for performance."},"626":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-14","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`maxIndicators`"},"627":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-15","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`number`"},"628":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-16","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`8`"},"629":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-17","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Max distant marker sprites drawn per frame. The active prompt is not counted. Raise it in busy areas if dots vanish when many targets are nearby."},"630":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-18","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`requireLookAt`"},"631":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-19","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`boolean`"},"632":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-20","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`true`"},"633":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-21","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"If true, the prompt only opens when the target is inside `lookRadius` of the reticle. If false, the closest valid nearby interact opens without aiming."},"634":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-22","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`lookRadius`"},"635":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-23","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`number`"},"636":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-24","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`0.08`"},"637":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-25","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"How close to screen center a target must be to open the prompt. Units are a fraction of screen height. Raise it to aim looser. Ignored when `requireLookAt` is false."},"638":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-26","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`autoCenter`"},"639":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-27","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`boolean`"},"640":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-28","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`true`"},"641":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-29","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"If true, entity options without `offset`, `offsetAbsolute`, or `bones` are placed at the model bounding-box center instead of the entity origin."},"642":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-30","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`requireLos`"},"643":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-31","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`boolean`"},"644":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-32","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`true`"},"645":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-33","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Hide interacts the player cannot see."},"646":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-34","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`losFlags`"},"647":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-35","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`number`"},"648":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-36","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`17`"},"649":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-37","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"What blocks line of sight. `1` world, `2` vehicles, `4` peds, `16` objects."},"650":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-38","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`losShellDepth`"},"651":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-39","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`number`"},"652":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-40","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`2.0`"},"653":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-41","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"How far collision in front of an ATM can be and still count as visible."},"654":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-42","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`hideWhenEmpty`"},"655":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-43","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`table`"},"656":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-44","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"globals `true`, others `false`"},"657":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-45","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Per interact type: hide the distant marker when every option on that target is currently invalid (`canInteract`, distance, groups, items, in-vehicle). Globals default to hide so nearby peds/vehicles/objects do not spam sprites. Models, entities, and coords keep the marker unless you set them to `true`."},"658":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-46","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`duiScale`"},"659":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-47","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`number`"},"660":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-48","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`0.12`"},"661":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-49","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"World size of the prompt sprite. The prompt fills the DUI texture, so this is the on-screen size of the prompt itself. Raise it to make the prompt larger in the world."},"662":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-50","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`duiResolution`"},"663":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-51","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`number`"},"664":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-52","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`2048`"},"665":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-53","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Cap on the DUI texture long edge. The texture is sized to 2x the on-screen sprite so type stays sharp. This only clamps very large resolutions."},"666":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-54","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`theme`"},"667":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-55","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`string`"},"668":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-56","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"`'modern'`"},"669":{"id":"/docs/interact/configuration-57","page_id":"/docs/interact/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/interact/configuration#options-explained","content":"Visual look of the world prompt. Must match a file in `web/themes/<id>.css`."},"670"